  "changelog": "Fixes the Zones menu jumping to the wrong zone (choosing Adamsville landed on Downtown, Mableton on Adamsville): the menu is now rebuilt every time game data loads \u2014 it previously kept the pre-download zone order while the loaded data had been rebuilt in game order, so each entry's position pointed at a different zone \u2014 and a menu entry now resolves by the zone name it displays, so a stale position can never send you to a different zone. A stale zone selection is also cleared on reload.",
